about what the developer wants where a wrong guess would waste real work. It also covers a request \
with a part marked "not shown" when that part could matter, since you can't judge what you can't see.

reason is one short sentence for the developer's log, addressing them as "you". When leaving it for \
them, say what they need to do.

choices is for leave_for_user when no options are listed: two to four answers the developer could send \
back with one click, in their voice, each under 80 characters and complete on its own. Include "done" \
style answers for things they do themselves. Otherwise leave it empty."""
VERDICT = {
